# Kasboek conventions

- Monorepo: `apps/web` (Vite React TS), `apps/api` (Go).
- API base path `/api/*`. Frontend may use Vite proxy or `VITE_API_BASE_URL`.
- Env from repo-root `.env` (see `.env.example`).
- Prefer small, verified changes. Prove with `curl` health + one UI path.
- Do not add auth, multi-tenant, or cloud deploy unless explicitly requested.
